The $N_{pe} = 32$ COD-BT implementation on mid-end ZCU102 delivers the best performance in both energy efficiency and throughput among all evaluated implementations. Specifically, it achieves 3.5× throughput and 2.2× energy efficiency improvements, compared to BAT \cite{ji2024co}, the state-of-the-art binary transformer accelerator. 
