\noindent
\textbf{Claim vi: sCore does not imply wEJR+ even for $\calE_{=1}$}
\vspace{0.02cm}

\noindent
Let $E_6=(C,N,\ell,A) \in \calE_{=1}$ be a temporal election with
4 candidates $C = \{a,b,c,d\}$,
7 voters $N = [7]$,
$\ell =7$ rounds,
and the ballots of voters as presented in \Cref{tab:prop:independence:vi}.

