\vspace{0.02cm}

\noindent
Let $E_8=(C,N,\ell,A) \in \calE_{=1}$ be a temporal election with
3 candidates $C = \{a,b,c\}$,
4 voters $N = [4]$,
$\ell =4$ rounds,
and the ballots of voters as presented in \Cref{tab:prop:independence:viii}.

\begin{table}[bht]
