u/5}{1+u}}}-1+u^{2}\frac{ \left(1+2 u\right)^{2}}{\left(1+u \right)^{2}}
\left(
\frac{\sqrt{5}}{5}+\frac{1}{\frac{{5}\, \sqrt{\left(1+u
\right) \left(1+\frac{u}{5}\right)}}{2}-u}
+\frac{2 \sqrt{5}}{5 \left(1+2 u \right)}\right),\\
