\noindent\textbf{Intended Audience.} This survey targets three primary audiences: (1) NLP researchers investigating security vulnerabilities and protections for language models; (2) ML engineers and practitioners responsible for deploying and securing LLMs in production environments; and (3) Security professionals tasked with protecting organizational AI assets and intellectual property. 
By bridging theoretical foundations with practical implementation considerations, this work provides actionable insights for both academic research and industrial applications in LLM security.
