\subsection{\textbf{RQ2}: Root Cause Analysis Cost Comparison}
Considering the cost and time consumption associated with LLMs, we analyzed the token usage and query rounds for each method from the baseline experiments. The distribution of the data is shown in the violin plots Figure \ref{violin_token} and \ref{violin_query}.

\begin{figure}[htbp]
